        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Myth of a Godslayer is a top-down Action-RPG mixing combat, exploration, puzzles and platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an original world inspired by Gallic Celtic mythology and great classics from the 16 and 32-bit eras such as <i>Beyond Oasis</i> and <i>The Legend of Oasis</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e2e8c19948c3c8984784b4be0b4c6c96.poster.avif?t=1769060167\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e2e8c19948c3c8984784b4be0b4c6c96.webm?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e2e8c19948c3c8984784b4be0b4c6c96.mp4?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Ready for a Mythical Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Holy City of Pandora is in turmoil since the discovery of new lands beyond the borders of the known world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A merciless territorial war has broken out between the three divine clans to seize the resources of this New World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the adventures of Klain, a Divine Warrior in the service of a tyrannical god, who will take advantage of this troubled era to achieve his own ambitions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the New World!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This vast continent is full of secrets, forgotten dungeons, and ferocious monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore devastated lands, gloomy swamps, lush forests, ancient temples...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert! Random events will occur regularly during your excursions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare monsters, enemy patrols, weather effects, challenges of all kinds... exploring the New World is never boring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/c1bbb6944a60e79081752038697e8f35.poster.avif?t=1769060167\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/c1bbb6944a60e79081752038697e8f35.webm?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/c1bbb6944a60e79081752038697e8f35.mp4?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Stronger!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, buy or craft your gear and then add gems on it to upgrade it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn combat Arcana, fearsome elemental techniques long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use divine artifacts that will help you fight your enemies, explore the New World and solve its many puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn the favor of an ancient deity and gain divine gifts, powerful passive effects that will strengthen you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Pandora, the Holy City!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world's political center, the city of Pandora houses the headquarters of the three divine clans and their respective gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the citizens of Pandora! Whether human, draconian, or pixie, many residents will seek Klain's assistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the expertise of Pandora's finest artisans to craft your own gear using resources from the New World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove yourself in Pandora's famous battle arena by facing off against hordes of enemies and the world's fiercest warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e25af033ff100ff814caae4994529d99.poster.avif?t=1769060167\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e25af033ff100ff814caae4994529d99.webm?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e25af033ff100ff814caae4994529d99.mp4?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for the Glory of your Clan!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The three divine clans clash in a permanent war for the conquest of the New World's territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in battles against the opposing clans to increase the size of your territory. Face the most formidable of the Divine Warriors, the commanders of the divine armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinguish yourself in the New World by performing feats to increase your personal renown, and thus gain the favor of the inhabitants and merchants of Pandora!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Notable Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully 3D collision engine in a colorful world with 2D graphics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 20 different environments and more than 650 unique maps to explore.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 unique enemies to fight, including around 20 bosses, as well as many variants.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully customizable controller and keyboard controls.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 difficulty modes and an optional help system for some puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive optional content including quests, additional dungeons and many secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 different endings. Klain's ultimate fate is in your hands!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Myth of a Godslayer is a top-down Action-RPG mixing combat, exploration, puzzles and platforming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an original world inspired by Gallic Celtic mythology and great classics from the 16 and 32-bit eras such as <i>Beyond Oasis</i> and <i>The Legend of Oasis</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e2e8c19948c3c8984784b4be0b4c6c96.poster.avif?t=1769060167\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e2e8c19948c3c8984784b4be0b4c6c96.webm?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e2e8c19948c3c8984784b4be0b4c6c96.mp4?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Ready for a Mythical Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Holy City of Pandora is in turmoil since the discovery of new lands beyond the borders of the known world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A merciless territorial war has broken out between the three divine clans to seize the resources of this New World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the adventures of Klain, a Divine Warrior in the service of a tyrannical god, who will take advantage of this troubled era to achieve his own ambitions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the New World!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This vast continent is full of secrets, forgotten dungeons, and ferocious monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore devastated lands, gloomy swamps, lush forests, ancient temples...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert! Random events will occur regularly during your excursions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare monsters, enemy patrols, weather effects, challenges of all kinds... exploring the New World is never boring!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/c1bbb6944a60e79081752038697e8f35.poster.avif?t=1769060167\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/c1bbb6944a60e79081752038697e8f35.webm?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/c1bbb6944a60e79081752038697e8f35.mp4?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Stronger!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, buy or craft your gear and then add gems on it to upgrade it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn combat Arcana, fearsome elemental techniques long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use divine artifacts that will help you fight your enemies, explore the New World and solve its many puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn the favor of an ancient deity and gain divine gifts, powerful passive effects that will strengthen you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Pandora, the Holy City!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world's political center, the city of Pandora houses the headquarters of the three divine clans and their respective gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the citizens of Pandora! Whether human, draconian, or pixie, many residents will seek Klain's assistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the expertise of Pandora's finest artisans to craft your own gear using resources from the New World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove yourself in Pandora's famous battle arena by facing off against hordes of enemies and the world's fiercest warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e25af033ff100ff814caae4994529d99.poster.avif?t=1769060167\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e25af033ff100ff814caae4994529d99.webm?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817260/extras/e25af033ff100ff814caae4994529d99.mp4?t=1769060167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for the Glory of your Clan!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The three divine clans clash in a permanent war for the conquest of the New World's territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in battles against the opposing clans to increase the size of your territory. Face the most formidable of the Divine Warriors, the commanders of the divine armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinguish yourself in the New World by performing feats to increase your personal renown, and thus gain the favor of the inhabitants and merchants of Pandora!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Notable Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully 3D collision engine in a colorful world with 2D graphics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 20 different environments and more than 650 unique maps to explore.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 unique enemies to fight, including around 20 bosses, as well as many variants.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fully customizable controller and keyboard controls.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 difficulty modes and an optional help system for some puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive optional content including quests, additional dungeons and many secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 different endings. Klain's ultimate fate is in your hands!</p></li></ul>",
